<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR APRIL 17/18.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR APRIL 17/18.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for April</p>
<p>17/18. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	    April 17/18   April 16/17</p>
<p> CZK	0.45882	  0.4559</p>
<p> DKK	2.10055	  2.10081</p>
<p> FIM	2.66759	  2.66589</p>
<p> HUF	0.07627	  0.07634</p>
<p> JPY	0.10993	  0.1095</p>
<p> LTL	3.4554	   3.44986</p>
<p> LVL     23.67197	 23.73505</p>
<p> RUR	0.0024	   0.0024</p>
<p> SEK	1.79184	  1.78991</p>
<p> UAH	7.48755	  7.47244</p>
<p> USD     13.8164	  13.796</p>
<p> XEU     15.63326	 15.63639</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
